   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "R3 + L-08: in OUTLAYS, a missing item goes back to the reviewer. Never\nO00999, never \"the best available\".\nA line without flags starts accepted; a flagged one starts pending.\nOutside this tree: VAT and discount → no code, HIGH, with a note · ambiguous\ninvoice → no code, LOW, flagged.",
   "originalText": "R3 + L-08: in OUTLAYS, a missing item goes back to the reviewer. Never\nO00999, never \"the best available\".\nA line without flags starts accepted; a flagged one starts pending.\nOutside this tree: VAT and discount → no code, HIGH, with a note · ambiguous\ninvoice → no code, LOW, flagged.",
   "fontSize": 14,
